   "type": "text",
   "id": "fin_t",
   "x": 124.80000000000001,
   "y": 717.5,
   "width": 950.4,
   "height": 140.0,
   "text": "Filters decided on the evidence\n\nuntyped: fewer than 2 junction clips typed to an element (unless one typed clip + tail + MEI mates,\nor typed by the mates with tail clips)\nnon_mei_mates: MEI mates below 30% of the checked mates\nCandidates without junction clips but mostly MEI mates (4+, 60%+, 0.98 identity) and reads clipped\nat the breakpoint pass as insertions (imprecise position)",
   "originalText": "Filters decided on the evidence\n\nuntyped: fewer than 2 junction clips typed to an element (unless one typed clip + tail + MEI mates,\nor typed by the mates with tail clips)\nnon_mei_mates: MEI mates below 30% of the checked mates\nCandidates without junction clips but mostly MEI mates (4+, 60%+, 0.98 identity) and reads clipped\nat the breakpoint pass as insertions (imprecise position)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
